 "card": "Converts the `building-on` triplet resolution in `contrib/guix/toolchains.scm` from an eagerly evaluated variable into a procedure evaluated when lowering derivations. When running Guix with `--system` on a foreign host via emulation (such as building for aarch64 on x86_64), manifests previously evaluated `%current-system` at module load time, generating an incorrect `--build` triplet that broke cross-toolchain configuration for `gcc-cross-sans-libc`. The change fixes emulated cross-system Guix builds without modifying the derivations produced for native release builds.",
